{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23858","headline":"令狐尚书许过弊居先赠长句 · 白居易","name":"令狐尚书许过弊居先赠长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不矜轩冕爱林泉，许到池头一醉眠。\n已遣平治行药迳，兼教扫拂钓鱼船。\n应将笔砚随诗主，定有笙歌伴酒仙。\n祗候高情无别物，苍苔石笋白花莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}